pub extern \"C\" fn c2Clampv(a: C2v, lo: C2v, hi: C2v) -> C2v {\n   144\t    c2Maxv(lo, c2Minv(a, hi))\n   145\t}\n   146\t\n   147\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   148\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Sub(mut a: C2v, b: C2v) -> C2v {\n   149\t    a.x -= b.x;\n   150\t    a.y -= b.y;\n   151\t    a\n   152\t}\n   153\t\n   154\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   155\t#[inline(never)]\n   156\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Dot(a: C2v, b: C2v) -> c_float {\n   157\t    a.x * b.x + a.y * b.y\n   158\t}\n   159\t\n   160\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   161\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2RotIdentity() -> C2r {\n   162\t    C2r { c: 1.0, s: 0.0 }\n   163\t}\n   164\t\n   165\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   166\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2xIdentity() -> C2x {\n   167\t    C2x {\n   168\t        p: c2V(0.0, 0.0),\n   169\t        r: c2RotIdentity(),\n   170\t    }\n   171\t}\n   172\t\n   173\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   174\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2BBVerts(out: *mut C2v, bb: *mut C2Aabb) {\n   175\t    unsafe {\n   176\t        *out.add(0) = (*bb).min;\n   177\t        *out.add(1) = c2V((*bb).max.x, (*bb).min.y);\n   178\t        *out.add(2) = (*bb).max;\n   179\t        *out.add(3) = c2V((*bb).min.x, (*bb).max.y);\n   180\t    }\n   181\t}\n   182\t\n   183\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   184\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2MakeProxy(\n   185\t    shape: *const c_void,\n   186\t    shape_type: C2Type,\n   187\t    p: *mut C2Proxy,\n   188\t) {\n   189\t    unsafe {\n   190\t        match shape_type {\n   191\t            C2_TYPE_CIRCLE => {\n   192\t                let c = &*(shape.cast::<C2Circle>());\n   193\t                (*p).radius = c.r;\n   194\t                (*p).count = 1;\n   195\t                (*p).verts[0] = c.p;\n   196\t            }\n   197\t            C2_TYPE_AABB => {\n   198\t                let bb = shape.cast::<C2Aabb>();\n   199\t                (*p).radius = 0.0;\n   200\t                (*p).count = 4;\n   201\t                c2BBVerts((*p).verts.as_mut_ptr(), bb.cast_mut());\n   202\t            }\n   203\t            C2_TYPE_CAPSULE => {\n   204\t                let c = &*(shape.cast::<C2Capsule>());\n   205\t                (*p).radius = c.r;\n   206\t                (*p).count = 2;\n   207\t                (*p).verts[0] = c.a;\n   208\t                (*p).verts[1] = c.b;\n   209\t            }\n   210\t            _ => {}\n   211\t        }\n   212\t    }\n   213\t}\n   214\t\n   215\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   216\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Len(a: C2v) -> c_float {\n   217\t    c2Dot(a, a).sqrt()\n   218\t}\n   219\t\n   220\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   221\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Det2(a: C2v, b: C2v) -> c_float {\n   222\t    a.x * b.y - a.y * b.x\n   223\t}\n   224\t\n   225\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   226\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2GJKSimplexMetric(s: *mut C2Simplex) -> c_float {\n   227\t    unsafe {\n   228\t        match (*s).count {\n   229\t            2 => c2Len(c2Sub((*s).b.p, (*s).a.p)),\n   230\t            3 => c2Det2(c2Sub((*s).b.p, (*s).a.p), c2Sub((*s).c.p, (*s).a.p)),\n   231\t            _ => 0.0,\n   232\t        }\n   233\t    }\n   234\t}\n   235\t\n   236\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   237\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Mulrv(a: C2r, b: C2v) -> C2v {\n   238\t    c2V(a.c * b.x - a.s * b.y, a.s * b.x + a.c * b.y)\n   239\t}\n   240\t\n   241\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   242\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Add(mut a: C2v, b: C2v) -> C2v {\n   243\t    a.x += b.x;\n   244\t    a.y += b.y;\n   245\t    a\n   246\t}\n   247\t\n   248\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   249\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Mulxv(a: C2x, b: C2v) -> C2v {\n   250\t    c2Add(c2Mulrv(a.r, b), a.p)\n   251\t}\n   252\t\n   253\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   254\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c22(s: *mut C2Simplex) {\n   255\t    unsafe {\n   256\t        let a = (*s).a.p;\n   257\t        let b = (*s).b.p;\n   258\t        let u = c2Dot(b, c2Sub(b, a));\n   259\t        let v = c2Dot(a, c2Sub(a, b));\n   260\t        if v <= 0.0 {\n   261\t            (*s).a.u = 1.0;\n   262\t            (*s).div = 1.0;\n   263\t            (*s).count = 1;\n   264\t        } else if u <= 0.0 {\n   265\t            (*s).a = (*s).b;\n   266\t            (*s).a.u = 1.0;\n   267\t            (*s).div = 1.0;\n   268\t            (*s).count = 1;\n   269\t        } else {\n   270\t            (*s).a.u = u;\n   271\t            (*s).b.u = v;\n   272\t            (*s).div = u + v;\n   273\t            (*s).count = 2;\n   274\t        }\n   275\t    }\n   276\t}\n   277\t\n   278\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   279\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c23(s: *mut C2Simplex) {\n   280\t    unsafe {\n   281\t        let a = (*s).a.p;\n   282\t        let b = (*s).b.p;\n   283\t        let c = (*s).c.p;\n   284\t        let uAB = c2Dot(b, c2Sub(b, a));\n   285\t        let vAB = c2Dot(a, c2Sub(a, b));\n   286\t        let uBC = c2Dot(c, c2Sub(c, b));\n   287\t        let vBC = c2Dot(b, c2Sub(b, c));\n   288\t        let uCA = c2Dot(a, c2Sub(a, c));\n   289\t        let vCA = c2Dot(c, c2Sub(c, a));\n   290\t        let area = c2Det2(c2Sub(b, a), c2Sub(c, a));\n   291\t        let uABC = c2Det2(b, c) * area;\n   292\t        let vABC = c2Det2(c, a) * area;\n   293\t        let wABC = c2Det2(a, b) * area;\n   294\t        if vAB <= 0.0 && uCA <= 0.0 {\n   295\t            (*s).a.u = 1.0;\n   296\t            (*s).div = 1.0;\n   297\t            (*s).count = 1;\n   298\t        } else if uAB <= 0.0 && vBC <= 0.0 {\n   299\t            (*s).a = (*s).b;\n   300\t            (*s).a.u = 1.0;\n   301\t            (*s).div = 1.0;\n   302\t            (*s).count = 1;\n   303\t        } else if uBC <= 0.0 && vCA <= 0.0 {\n   304\t            (*s).a = (*s).c;\n   305\t            (*s).a.u = 1.0;\n   306\t            (*s).div = 1.0;\n   307\t            (*s).count = 1;\n   308\t        } else if uAB > 0.0 && vAB > 0.0 && wABC <= 0.0 {\n   309\t            (*s).a.u = uAB;\n   310\t            (*s).b.u = vAB;\n   311\t            (*s).div = uAB + vAB;\n   312\t            (*s).count = 2;\n   313\t        } else if uBC > 0.0 && vBC > 0.0 && uABC <= 0.0 {\n   314\t            (*s).a = (*s).b;\n   315\t            (*s).b = (*s).c;\n   316\t            (*s).a.u = uBC;\n   317\t            (*s).b.u = vBC;\n   318\t            (*s).div = uBC + vBC;\n   319\t            (*s).count = 2;\n   320\t        } else if uCA > 0.0 && vCA > 0.0 && vABC <= 0.0 {\n   321\t            (*s).b = (*s).a;\n   322\t            (*s).a = (*s).c;\n   323\t            (*s).a.u = uCA;\n   324\t            (*s).b.u = vCA;\n   325\t            (*s).div = uCA + vCA;\n   326\t            (*s).count = 2;\n   327\t        } else {\n   328\t            (*s).a.u = uABC;\n   329\t            (*s).b.u = vABC;\n   330\t            (*s).c.u = wABC;\n   331\t            (*s).div = uABC + vABC + wABC;\n   332\t            (*s).count = 3;\n   333\t        }\n   334\t    }\n   335\t}\n   336\t\n   337\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   338\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Neg(a: C2v) -> C2v {\n   339\t    c2V(-a.x, -a.y)\n   340\t}\n   341\t\n   342\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   343\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Skew(a: C2v) -> C2v {\n   344\t    C2v { x: -a.y, y: a.x }\n   345\t}\n   346\t\n   347\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   348\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2CCW90(a: C2v) -> C2v {\n   349\t    C2v { x: a.y, y: -a.x }\n   350\t}\n   351\t\n   352\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   353\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2D(s: *mut C2Simplex) -> C2v {\n   354\t    unsafe {\n   355\t        match (*s).count {\n   356\t            1 => c2Neg((*s).a.p),\n   357\t            2 => {\n   358\t                let ab = c2Sub((*s).b.p, (*s).a.p);\n   359\t                if c2Det2(ab, c2Neg((*s).a.p)) > 0.0 {\n   360\t                    c2Skew(ab)\n   361\t                } else {\n   362\t                    c2CCW90(ab)\n   363\t                }\n   364\t            }\n   365\t            _ => c2V(0.0, 0.0),\n   366\t        }\n   367\t    }\n   368\t}\n   369\t\n   370\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   371\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2Support(\n   372\t    verts: *const C2v,\n   373\t    count: c_int,\n   374\t    d: C2v,\n   375\t) -> c_int {\n   376\t    unsafe {\n   377\t        let mut imax = 0;\n   378\t        let mut dmax = c2Dot(*verts, d);\n   379\t        let mut i = 1;\n   380\t        while i < count {\n   381\t            let dot = c2Dot(*verts.add(i as usize), d);\n   382\t            if dot > dmax {\n   383\t                imax = i;\n   384\t                dmax = dot;\n   385\t            }\n   386\t            i += 1;\n   387\t        }\n   388\t        imax\n   389\t    }\n   390\t}\n   391\t\n   392\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   393\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2Witness(s: *mut C2Simplex, a: *mut C2v, b: *mut C2v) {\n   394\t    unsafe {\n   395\t        let den = 1.0 / (*s).div;\n   396\t        match (*s).count {\n   397\t            1 => {\n   398\t                *a = (*s).a.sA;\n   399\t                *b = (*s).a.sB;\n   400\t            }\n   401\t            2 => {\n   402\t                *a = c2Add(\n   403\t                    c2Mulvs((*s).a.sA, den * (*s).a.u),\n   404\t                    c2Mulvs((*s).b.sA, den * (*s).b.u),\n   405\t                );\n   406\t                *b = c2Add(\n   407\t                    c2Mulvs((*s).a.sB, den * (*s).a.u),\n   408\t                    c2Mulvs((*s).b.sB, den * (*s).b.u),\n   409\t                );\n   410\t            }\n   411\t            3 => {\n   412\t                *a = c2Add(\n   413\t                    c2Add(\n   414\t                        c2Mulvs((*s).a.sA, den * (*s).a.u),\n   415\t                        c2Mulvs((*s).b.sA, den * (*s).b.u),\n   416\t                    ),\n   417\t                    c2Mulvs((*s).c.sA, den * (*s).c.u),\n   418\t                );\n   419\t                *b = c2Add(\n   420\t                    c2Add(\n   421\t                        c2Mulvs((*s).a.sB, den * (*s).a.u),\n   422\t                        c2Mulvs((*s).b.sB, den * (*s).b.u),\n   423\t                    ),\n   424\t                    c2Mulvs((*s).c.sB, den * (*s).c.u),\n   425\t                );\n   426\t            }\n   427\t            _ => {\n   428\t                *a = c2V(0.0, 0.0);\n   429\t                *b = c2V(0.0, 0.0);\n   430\t            }\n   431\t        }\n   432\t    }\n   433\t}\n   434\t\n   435\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   436\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Div(a: C2v, b: c_float) -> C2v {\n   437\t    c2Mulvs(a, 1.0 / b)\n   438\t}\n   439\t\n   440\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   441\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2Norm(a: C2v) -> C2v {\n   442\t    c2Div(a, c2Len(a))\n   443\t}\n   444\t\n   445\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   446\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2L(s: *mut C2Simplex) -> C2v {\n   447\t    unsafe {\n   448\t        let den = 1.0 / (*s).div;\n   449\t        match (*s).count {\n   450\t            1 => (*s).a.p,\n   451\t            2 => c2Add(\n   452\t                c2Mulvs((*s).a.p, den * (*s).a.u),\n   453\t                c2Mulvs((*s).b.p, den * (*s).b.u),\n   454\t            ),\n   455\t            _ => c2V(0.0, 0.0),\n   456\t        }\n   457\t    }\n   458\t}\n   459\t\n   460\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   461\tpub extern \"C\" fn c2MulrvT(a: C2r, b: C2v) -> C2v {\n   462\t    c2V(a.c * b.x + a.s * b.y, -a.s * b.x + a.c * b.y)\n   463\t}\n   464\t\n   465\t#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\n   466\tpub unsafe extern \"C\" fn c2GJK(\n   467\t    A: *const c_void,\n   468\t    typeA: C2Type,\n   469\t    ax_ptr: *const C2x,\n   470\t    B: *const c_void,\n   471\t    typeB: C2Type,\n   472\t    bx_ptr: *const C2x,\n   473\t    outA: *mut C2v,\n   474\t    outB: *mut C2v,\n   475\t    use_radius: c_int,\n   476\t    iterations: *mut c_int,\n   477\t    cache: *mut C2GjkCache,\n   478\t) -> c_float {\n   479\t    unsafe {\n   480\t        let ax = if ax_ptr.is_null() {\n   481\t            c2xIdentity()\n   482\t        } else {\n   483\t            *ax_ptr\n   484\t        };\n   485\t        let bx = if bx_ptr.is_null() {\n   486\t            c2xIdentity()\n   487\t        } else {\n   488\t            *bx_ptr\n   489\t        };\n   490\t        let mut pA = C2Proxy::default();\n   491\t        let mut pB = C2Proxy::default();\n   492\t        c2MakeProxy(A, typeA, &mut pA);\n   493\t        c2MakeProxy(B, typeB, &mut pB);\n   494\t        let mut s = C2Simplex::default();\n   495\t        let verts = &mut s.a as *mut C2sv;\n   496\t        let mut cache_was_read = 0;\n   497\t        if !cache.is_null() {\n   498\t            let cache_was_good = ((*cache).count != 0) as c_int;\n   499\t            if cache_was_good != 0 {\n   500\t                let mut i = 0;\n   501\t                while i < (*cache).count {\n   502\t                    let iA = (*cache).iA[i as usize];\n   503\t                    let iB = (*cache).iB[i as usize];\n   504\t                    let sA = c2Mulxv(ax, pA.verts[iA as usize]);\n   505\t                    let sB = c2Mulxv(bx, pB.verts[iB as usize]);\n   506\t                    let v = &mut *verts.add(i as usize);\n   507\t                    v.iA = iA;\n   508\t                    v.sA = sA;\n   509\t                    v.iB = iB;\n   510\t                    v.sB = sB;\n   511\t                    v.p = c2Sub(v.sB, v.sA);\n   512\t                    v.u = 0.0;\n   513\t                    i += 1;\n   514\t                }\n   515\t                s.count = (*cache).count;\n   516\t                s.div = (*cache).div;\n   517\t                let metric_old = (*cache).metric;\n   518\t                let metric = c2GJKSimplexMetric(&mut s);\n   519\t                let min_metric = if metric < metric_old {\n   520\t                    metric\n   521\t                } else {\n   522\t                    metric_old\n   523\t                };\n   524\t                let max_metric = if metric > metric_old {\n   525\t                    metric\n   526\t                } else {\n   527\t                    metric_old\n   528\t                };\n   529\t                if !(min_metric < max_metric * 2.0 && metric < -1.0e8) {\n   530\t                    cache_was_read = 1;\n   531\t                }\n   532\t            }\n   533\t        }\n   534\t        if cache_was_read == 0 {\n   535\t            s.a.iA = 0;\n   536\t            s.a.iB = 0;\n   537\t            s.a.sA = c2Mulxv(ax, pA.verts[0]);\n   538\t            s.a.sB = c2Mulxv(bx, pB.verts[0]);\n   539\t            s.a.p = c2Sub(s.a.sB, s.a.sA);\n   540\t            s.a.u = 1.0;\n   541\t            s.div = 1.0;\n   542\t            s.count = 1;\n   543\t        }\n   544\t        let mut saveA = [0; 3];\n   545\t        let mut saveB = [0; 3];\n   546\t        let mut save_count;\n   547\t        let mut d0 = c_float::MAX;\n   548\t        let mut iter = 0;\n   549\t        let mut hit = 0;\n   550\t        while iter < 20 {\n   551\t            save_count = s.count;\n   552\t            let mut i = 0;\n   553\t            while i < save_count {\n   554\t                saveA[i as usize] = (*verts.add(i as usize)).iA;\n   555\t                saveB[i as usize] = (*verts.add(i as usize)).iB;\n   556\t                i += 1;\n   557\t            }\n   558\t            match s.count {\n   559\t                2 => c22(&mut s),\n   560\t                3 => c23(&mut s),\n   561\t                _ => {}\n   562\t            }\n   563\t            if s.count == 3 {\n   564\t                hit = 1;\n   565\t                break;\n   566\t            }\n   567\t            let p = c2L(&mut s);\n   568\t            let d1 = c2Dot(p, p);\n   569\t            if d1 > d0 {\n   570\t                break;\n   571\t            }\n   572\t            d0 = d1;\n   573\t            let d = c2D(&mut s);\n   574\t            if c2Dot(d, d) < c_float::EPSILON * c_float::EPSILON {\n   575\t                break;\n   576\t            }\n   577\t            let iA = c2Support(\n   578\t                pA.verts.as_ptr(),\n   579\t                pA.count,\n   580\t                c2MulrvT(ax.r, c2Neg(d)),\n   581\t            );\n   582\t            let sA = c2Mulxv(ax, pA.verts[iA as usize]);\n   583\t            let iB = c2Support(pB.verts.as_ptr(), pB.count, c2MulrvT(bx.r, d));\n   584\t            let sB = c2Mulxv(bx, pB.verts[iB as usize]);\n   585\t            let v = &mut *verts.add(s.count as usize);\n   586\t            v.iA = iA;\n   587\t            v.sA = sA;\n   588\t            v.iB = iB;\n   589\t            v.sB = sB;\n   590\t            v.p = c2Sub(v.sB, v.sA);\n   591\t            let mut dup = 0;\n   592\t            let mut i = 0;\n   593\t            while i < save_count {\n   594\t                if iA == saveA[i as usize] && iB == saveB[i as usize] {\n   595\t                    dup = 1;\n   596\t                    break;\n   597\t                }\n   598\t                i += 1;\n   599\t            }\n   600\t            if dup != 0 {\n   601\t                break;\n   602\t            }\n   603\t            s.count += 1;\n   604\t            iter += 1;\n   605\t        }\n   606\t        let mut a = C2v::default();\n   607\t        let mut b = C2v::default();\n   608\t        c2Witness(&mut s, &mut a, &mut b);\n   609\t        let mut dist = c2Len(c2Sub(a, b));\n   610\t        if hit != 0 {\n   611\t            a = b;\n   612\t            dist = 0.0;\n   613\t        } else if use_radius != 0 {\n   614\t            let rA = pA.radius;\n   615\t            let rB = pB.radius;\n   616\t            if dist > rA + rB && dist > c_float::EPSILON {\n   617\t                dist -= rA + rB;\n   618\t                let n = c2Norm(c2Sub(b, a));\n   619\t                a = c2Add(a, c2Mulvs(n, rA));\n   620\t                b = c2Sub(b, c2Mulvs(n, rB));\n   621\t                if a.x == b.x && a.y == b.y {\n   622\t                    dist = 0.0;\n   623\t                }\n   624\t            } else {\n   625\t                let p = c2Mulvs(c2Add(a, b), 0.5);\n   626\t                a = p;\n   627\t                b = p;\n   628\t                dist = 0.0;\n   629\t            }\n   630\t        }\n   631\t        if !cache.is_null() {\n 